# Routine — <ROUTINE_NAME>

> One file per routine, checked in (suggested home: `docs/routines/<ROUTINE_NAME>.md`).
> This file IS the routine: its prompt is generated from the charter below, it is diffed and
> reviewed like code, and every tuning pass appends to the log at the bottom.
> See `docs/14-STANDING-ROUTINES.md` for the seven conventions this template encodes.

